Item 6: Job Object/no-breakaway/no-handle-inheritance/短命子进程 token evidence/PID 复用/未知后代 fail-closed. r2 line 108-109: suspended creation, single job, kill-on-job-close, no breakaway, all descendants in same job/package SID ✓; process-create/exit events + Job Object notifications to capture the tree incl. short-lived ✓; per PID+creation time records many token fields ✓; PID reuse distinguished by creation time ✓; unable to capture/read token → UNKNOWN and stop ✓; "若实际 P02 hook worker 无法满足此观测/继承边界，Build Gate 继续 BLOCKED" ✓. Also line 110: first-round preflight only runs no-project-code synthetic parent→child→grandchild probe ✓.

